<title>USA: TransTechnology names Joseph Spanier CFO.</title>
<headline>TransTechnology names Joseph Spanier CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>TransTechnology Corp said it named Joseph Spanier as chief financial officer, effective January 1.</p>
<p>Spanier, 50, replaces Chandler Moisen, who was named executive vice president.</p>
<p>Spanier joined the company on November 11 from Hoechst AG's MG Industries unit, where he was chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company makes fasteners, rescue hoists and cargo hooks.</p>
